  "body": "Experience contemporary living in one of Auckland's most sought-after neighborhoods. This stunning apartment beautifully combines convenience, luxury, and exceptional educational opportunities, all nestled in the vibrant community of Takapuna, known for its stunning beaches and outstanding amenities.\r\n\r\nApartment Features:\r\n\r\n* Bedrooms: 2\r\n\r\n* Bathrooms: 1\r\n\r\n* Carpark: 1\r\n\r\n* Interior Area: 66sqm\r\n\r\n* Winter Garden: 7sqm\r\n\r\n* Total Area: 73sqm\r\n\r\n* Body Corporate Levy: $4855.67 annually (from 31 March 2025 to 30 March 2026)\r\n\r\n* Rental Appraisal: $650 - $680 per week\r\n\r\nConvenient Transportation: Located on Esmonde Road, you'll enjoy easy access to major highways, making commuting effortless. The Auckland CBD is just a short drive away, with excellent public transport options available for seamless connectivity.\r\n\r\nTop School Zones: This apartment is in the catchment for some of Auckland's premier schools, including Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar School, Belmont Intermediate, and Westlake Girls' High School, providing exceptional education opportunities for families.\r\n\r\nAmenities: Embrace a vibrant lifestyle with Takapuna Beach, trendy cafes, diverse restaurants, and shopping center all within a short distance. The area also boasts beautiful parks and recreational facilities, perfect for outdoor enthusiasts.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this unique opportunity to own a brand-new, premium apartment in one of the North Shore's most desirable locations. Contact us today via phone or email to secure your future home and become part of this exciting new community!\r\n\r\nBy appointment or as advertised online.",
